@startuml

title DealFit - Future-State Sponsorship Screening Workflow

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F7F9FC
  BorderColor #4A5568
  FontColor #1A202C
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF4CC
  DiamondBorderColor #B7791F
}
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568

|Brand / Platform|
start
:Send sponsorship pitch through\nEmail / DM / Creator Marketplace;

|Creator|
:Open DealFit;
:Select or update persistent\ncreator profile;
:Paste pitch and enter known\ndeal terms;

|DealFit Application|
:Structure pitch into\nstandard screening fields;
:Check mandatory information;

if (Critical information missing?) then (Yes)
  :Flag missing information;
  :Set confidence to Low;
  :Recommend Need More Information\n/ Manual Review;
  |Creator|
  :Review missing items;
  :Request clarification from brand\nor continue manual review;
  |Brand / Platform|
  :Provide additional information;
  |Creator|
  :Update pitch details in DealFit;
  |DealFit Application|
else (No)
endif

|Deterministic Rules|
:Check creator exclusions,\nminimum requirements, usage-rights\nand exclusivity rules;

if (Hard creator conflict?) then (Yes)
  :Create hard-conflict flag;
  |DealFit Application|
  :Recommend Decline or\nManual Review;
else (No)
  |AI Assessment|
  :Assess niche alignment, audience fit,\nbrief clarity and values alignment;
  :Identify softer concerns,\ntrade-offs and negotiation signals;
  :Separate provided facts,\nAI inferences and items requiring verification;

  |DealFit Application|
  :Combine rule results and AI assessment;
  :Calculate DealFit score and\nconfidence state;
  :Generate recommendation, reasons,\nrisk flags and next action;

  if (Low confidence or elevated risk?) then (Yes)
    :Recommend Manual Review /\nNeed More Information;
  else (No)
    if (Strong fit and acceptable terms?) then (Yes)
      :Recommend Accept;
    elseif (Good potential but terms need change?) then (Negotiate)
      :Recommend Negotiate;
    else (Weak fit)
      :Recommend Decline;
    endif
  endif
endif

|Creator|
:Review score, recommendation, confidence,\nreasons, risk flags and missing information;

if (Creator agrees with recommendation?) then (Yes)
  :Record final creator decision;
else (No)
  :Override recommendation;
  :Optionally record override reason;
endif

|DealFit Application|
:Store recommendation, final decision\nand override feedback for evaluation;
:No external action is executed automatically;

|Creator|
:Take final human-approved action:\nAccept / Negotiate / Decline /\nRequest Information / Manual Review;
stop

@enduml
